{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill Up The Hole is a game where you help peons create as much garbage as possible and toss it into a hole. Watch your village grow and evolve as you unlock visual upgrades and new features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throw Garbage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your peons will automatically gather garbage and toss it into the hole. The more they throw, the bigger your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/peon_throw_small.gif?t=1745420145\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your village to maximize the amount of garbage produced and thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/city_small.gif?t=1745420145\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock upgrades and abilities to enhance your buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/upgrade_small.gif?t=1745420145\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Strategies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Expand your base by taking time removing rocks.<br>- Create and upgrade different buildings.<br>- The order of the building can make the difference.<br>- Enhance the abilities of the peons.<br>- Gain new research, talents and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343160/extras/bull_small.gif?t=1745420145\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343160?t=1745420145","background_raw":"htt